{"evt":"summary_set","id":"phase4/unification","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","summary":"Phase 4 unification — entity as conversation/execution join key. Extended POST /entity/link to accept task keys (task→entity, entity→task) alongside existing note/entity combos, with at-least-one-entity guard. Auto-wire tasks to entities at creation time by label substring match in two places: ensureTaskSnapshot (synthetic tasks) and the POST /overlay/status !_hasVec branch (real tasks at first claim), both best-effort/swallowed so task creation is never blocked. Added GET /entity/:id/context?workspace=&asOf= route returning unified {entity, facts(note nodes), tasks(task nodes), summary} with temporal filtering. Added read-only GET /entity?name= lookup endpoint and entity_context MCP tool in lib/mcp-core.js that does a two-step name→id lookup then fetches unified context. Cherry-picked Phase 2 entity layer (adff6b0) and Phase 3 hybrid RRF retrieval (9cf3fef) as prereqs. 175/176 tests pass; cursor-e2e was already failing before changes.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-18T15:10:08.069Z"}
